--- (b1) split arithmetic at the published defaults ---
   n  ne n_train nmin Kmax frac_train
  50  35      15    6    5      0.300
 100  50      50    8    6      0.500
 500 111     389   11   10      0.778

  ne      = size of the VALIDATION set (where the chi-square is formed)
  n_train = n - ne = rows left to (i) REFIT the logistic model and
            (ii) grow the parRF partition forest.
  df of the per-split chi-square = ngp (the number of groups), BAGofT_sin():
            P = 1 - pchisq(chisq, ngp)

